0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 629.60 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 627.00 Td (It must contain characters from at least three of these four classes: lowercase letters, uppercase) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 612.50 Td (letters, numbers, and symbols.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 597.10 3.00 3.00 re f
