BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 428.50 Td (minutes, allow at most 3 attempts, and enforce a 60-second cooldown between resend requests.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 413.10 3.00 3.00 re f
