0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 64.00 742.00 34.00 2.50 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 64.00 716.00 Td (Scheduling is backed by PostgreSQL. The publishing worker claims due posts with row-level locks so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 64.00 701.00 Td (that a post is processed by exactly one worker, exactly once.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 680.60 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 678.00 Td (Due posts are claimed with SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED. The row lock makes duplicate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 663.50 Td (publishing impossible, even if several workers run at the same time.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 648.10 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 645.50 Td (The claim query refuses posts that belong to suspended or deleted accounts. This hold is enforced at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 631.00 Td (the database level, so a suspension and a worker claim cannot race each other.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 615.60 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 613.00 Td (Held posts stay held until an administrator resumes them. Resuming an overdue held post is blocked;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 598.50 Td (the post must be rescheduled instead of being published immediately, which prevents surprise) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 584.00 Td (duplicate or late publishing.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 568.60 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 566.00 Td (Every create, hold, resume, retry, publish, and failure is recorded in the activity infrastructure with a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 551.50 Td (scheduled_post action.) Tj ET
0.937 0.965 1 rg 64.00 477.50 467.28 61.00 re f
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 64.00 477.50 3.00 61.00 re f
BT /F2 9 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 78.00 523.50 Td (Enforced by the application) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 78.00 510.50 Td (Row-level claim locking, account-state enforcement, hold behavior, and audit logging of publishing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 78.00 497.00 Td (actions are part of the scheduler's core transaction logic.) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 0.420 0.447 0.502 rg 64.00 461.50 Td (Administrators can review every scheduled post, including held and failed ones, from the Scheduler page.) Tj ET
