BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 716.00 Td (Sensitive values such as social tokens, OAuth secrets, and passwords are never displayed in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 701.50 Td (dashboard and are never returned by an admin API.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 686.10 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 683.50 Td (Social account tokens remain encrypted at rest with AES-256-GCM.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 668.10 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 665.50 Td (Activity metadata is sanitized before it is stored. Passwords, tokens, secrets, and encryption keys) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 651.00 Td (never enter activity records.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 635.60 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 633.00 Td (Every admin API request verifies the Super Admin session server-side before it processes data.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 617.60 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 615.00 Td (Database access runs server-side through an authorized service connection. An optional hardening) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 600.50 Td (migration additionally enables row-level security on the scheduling and authentication tables and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 586.00 Td (revokes direct browser-facing access to them.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 570.60 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 568.00 Td (Deleting a user is a soft delete that preserves audit history, and account relationships are protected) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 553.50 Td (by database foreign keys.) Tj ET
