BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 64.00 716.00 Td (Most protections described in this guide run automatically. A smaller set of good practices depends on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 64.00 701.00 Td (you as the administrator. These are recommendations, not enforced features.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 64.00 666.00 Td (Recommended practices) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 662.60 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 660.00 Td (Use a strong, unique administrator password that meets the console minimum of 12 characters with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 645.50 Td (three of four character types, and do not reuse it on other services.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 630.10 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 627.50 Td (Never share administrator credentials or one-time codes with anyone. No legitimate support process) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 613.00 Td (will ask for them.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 597.60 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 595.00 Td (Sign out other sessions from Settings when a device is lost, replaced, or no longer used.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 579.60 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 577.00 Td (Review social account connection statuses periodically and reconnect any expired or invalid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 562.50 Td (connection before its next scheduled post.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 547.10 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 544.50 Td (Review scheduled posts before their publish window and hold anything that is not ready to go out.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 529.10 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 526.50 Td (Keep the authentication and email delivery configuration valid and up to date so one-time codes and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 80.00 512.00 Td (security messages actually arrive.) Tj ET
0.965 0.973 0.980 rg 64.00 438.00 467.28 61.00 re f
